<title>UK: Halifax raises 1996 profits 6.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Halifax raises 1996 profits 6.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax			 1,430		vs 1,341</p>
<p> Total assets		 115,539	    vs 99,281</p>
<p> Bad/doubtful debt charge 118		  vs 107</p>
<p>NOTE - The Halifax said its pre-tax profit figure included 502 million stg of exceptional charges including 298 million stg of reorganisation and integration costs, 51 million stg on disposal of fixed assets and 153 million stg being the total cost of conversion.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864</p>
</text>
